      "remediation": "Do not unpickle untrusted data. Either (a) replace pickle with a data-only format (e.g. json.loads, as already done in json_store.py) for job ingestion, or (b) if binary objects are required, sign the payload with an HMAC (hmac.new(secret, payload, hashlib.sha256)) computed by the producer and verify it before unpickling, with constant-time comparison and key rotation; additionally restrict unpickling with a RestrictedUnpickler subclass that overrides find_class to allowlist only required builtins. Reject payloads that fail verification before any deserialization occurs."
    }
  ],
  "scanned_files": ["app/jobs.py", "app/json_store.py"],
  "source_modified": false
}
